{
  "name": "companion-daemon",
  "version": "0.3.0",
  "description": "CLI Agent 伴侣桌面 daemon：Claude Code hooks 状态归一化 + PetLink v1 设备链路 + 语音输入输出 + 会话统计 + 摇杆导航",
  "main": "src/server.js",
  "scripts": {
    "start": "node src/server.js",
